{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026c1hDoZXMSP1795298100.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一股清勁至強風程度的偏東氣流，正影響廣東沿岸。</p><p></p><p>本港大致多雲，多區氣溫入夜後跌至20度以下。在西九文化區，不少外出的市民都穿上外套保暖。預測早上市區最低氣溫約19度，新界再低幾度，日間最高氣溫約23度。</p><p></p><p>展望周一多雲，初時風勢仍然頗大。預料東北季候風周二抵達華南沿岸，下周中期轉吹偏北風，天氣轉涼及有幾陣雨。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T22:39:23.553966+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T21:03:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T02:41:55.896987+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T22:32:45.328546+00:00","content_hash":"c01c9e2ead98ad40b01780900c0a4d6ea9df0ca193498b13bcd324e64762c6da","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T22:39:23.553966+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}